{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Beta House is a horror game that contains many Internet memes. It contains a lot of funny, curious content, but the main tone is horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a fan of YiLian, invited to the Beta House that YiLian bought, which was affected by the nuclear radiation of the First Beta World War, there are many strange creatures and strange phenomena, you will help YiLian to destroy the remaining NaNazuists of the Beta House and prevent the second Beta World War.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're not careful, you'll fall into the beta back room, which seems more dangerous</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet curious creatures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat the odds with YiLian</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Happy security? Weird bugs? Purple Mood boss? How to beat?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more bang bang bang......</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556460?t=1742497925","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556460/ba3c1ee10e55cdcddfad062e9c32a1122b5e36e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742497925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556460/8b0c8020cc59cc820429652d23ae77d8229a8514/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742497925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556460/8b0c8020cc59cc820429652d23ae77d8229a8514/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742497925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Beta House is a horror game that contains many Internet memes. It contains a lot of funny, curious content, but the main tone is horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a fan of YiLian, invited to the Beta House that YiLian bought, which was affected by the nuclear radiation of the First Beta World War, there are many strange creatures and strange phenomena, you will help YiLian to destroy the remaining NaNazuists of the Beta House and prevent the second Beta World War.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're not careful, you'll fall into the beta back room, which seems more dangerous</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet curious creatures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat the odds with YiLian</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Happy security? Weird bugs? Purple Mood boss? How to beat?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more bang bang bang......</p></li></ul>","developers":["\u8d1d\u5854\u597d\u7f8a\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556460/91b4545655e7c8305cd3d47dea2c1356b89a1f0e/header.jpg?t=1742497925","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u8d1d\u5982\u5854\u4e4b\u5bb6 Beta House","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4460 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 760 or AMD Radeon\u2122 R7 260x with 2GB Video RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true}